<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="csrf-token" content="${pdict.csrf.token}">

    <isif condition="${pdict.meta}">
        <isloop items="${pdict.meta}" var="metaTag">
            <isprint value="${metaTag}" encoding="off" />
        </isloop>
    </isif>

    <isinclude url="${URLUtils.url('Inertia-Head', 'component', pdict.page.component)}" />
</head>

<body>
    <!--
    THESIS: The store as the moment of wrapping — every product a ticketed,
    tissue-wrapped good; refuses the minimal-luxury white-hero default.
    OWN-WORLD: Tissue ground, kraft fields, rubber-stamp red accents, near-black
    ink; Archivo wdth axis (condensed ticket caps / expanded stamp display),
    Spline Sans Mono meta; swing tags, punched tickets, barcode strips, twine rules.
    STORY: A shopper lands in a wrapping room, reads the season stamped on kraft,
    pulls a category ticket, and browses ticketed goods they can refine and sort.
    FIRST VIEWPORT: Full-bleed kraft hero; stamped headline left at display scale,
    swing-tag CTA beneath it, barcode strip grounding the fold; nav tickets above.
    FORM: Hangtag & garment-bag packaging — grounded candidate 4, seed df4b12fa.
    FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the
    finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md
    -->
    <iscomment>
        The @inertiajs v3.6 client boots from this JSON script tag
        (script[data-page="app"][type="application/json"]) and mounts into the
        empty #app div. pageJson is pre-escaped by the adapter (angle brackets are JSON-escaped so a prop value can never break out of this script tag).
    </iscomment>
    <script data-page="app" type="application/json"><isprint value="${pdict.pageJson}" encoding="off"/></script>
    <div id="app"></div>
</body>

</html>
